    <string name="credits_title">Open-Source Models, Libraries &amp; Credits</string>
    <string name="credits_intro">DxVoice-IME is built upon these outstanding open-source AI models and software projects:</string>
    <string name="credits_body">[Open-Source Speech &amp; Language Models]\n• SenseVoice (FunAudioLLM / Alibaba): Multi-lingual offline ASR for ZH/YUE/EN/JA/KO (Apache-2.0)\n• OpenAI Whisper (Tiny / Base): Multi-lingual offline speech recognition (MIT)\n• CT-Transformer (FunASR / Alibaba): Offline punctuation restoration (MIT)\n• Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct (Alibaba Qwen / LiteRT Community): On-device fast small LLM for text polishing (Apache-2.0)\n\n[Open-Source Inference Engines &amp; Libraries]\n• Sherpa-ONNX (k2-fsa / Next-gen Kaldi): On-device ASR &amp; punctuation runtime (Apache-2.0)\n• Google MediaPipe Tasks GenAI (Google AI Edge): On-device LLM inference engine (Apache-2.0)\n• AndroidX / Jetpack Compose / Material 3 (Google): Modern adaptive UI toolkit (Apache-2.0)\n• OkHttp (Square) &amp; Apache Commons Compress: Networking &amp; model archive extraction (Apache-2.0)\n• Android ICU (Unicode) &amp; Google ML Kit: Full Chinese script conversion &amp; on-device translation</string>
    <string name="credits_special_thanks">Special Thanks: Co-development &amp; testing contributors — 曉東 (XiaoDong), Kimi!</string>
